From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sgnetsvc, services, cfgmgr32: Windows' network services, dependencies started first, SwDeviceCreate

DNS Client, IP Helper, Network List Service and WinHTTP Web Proxy Auto-Discovery Service exist and run, as svchost services, and the service manager starts a service's dependencies first as Windows does. Software device creation and device queries exist in cfgmgr32 and fail cleanly. The Tailscale installer stopped at its check that the DNS Client exists; its service depends on all four.
---
